Luthkar Madina Zainab Tashreef Larahi Hai<br>
Turbat Pe Fatima Ki Aansu Baharahi Hai<br>
<br>
1.Balou Se Muh Ku Apne Dukhiya Chuparahi Hai<br>
Shaanou Ke Neel Maa Ku Zainab Dikharahi Hai<br>
<br>
2.Amma Main Berida Thi Balwe Me Aashqiyan Ke<br>
Ahwal Sab Safar Ke Zainab Sunarahi Hai<br>
<br>
3. Turbat Pe Maa Ki Aayi Rudad-e-Gham Sunayi<br>
Kurta Lahu Bhara Ek Maa Ku Dikharahi Hai<br>
<br>
4.Sar Pe Liye Hai Tuhfe Maidan-e-Karbala Ke<br>
Mehshar Se Phele Meshar Zainab Utharahi Hai<br>
<br>
5.Khoram Ek Macha Hai Majlis Yahan Bapa Hai<br>
Arsh-e-Bari Ku Zainab Rokar Hilarahi Hai<br>
<br>
6.Iqbal Kya Sunaye Zainab Ke Dil KI Halat<br>
Mar Mar Ke Jeene Wali Jeena Sekharahi Hai
